---
// Axi-Theme homepage structure, adapted to Desplog's own profile and content.
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import avatar from '../assets/me.png';
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import PostList from '../components/PostList.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';

const posts = (await getCollection('blog')).sort((a, b) => b.data.pubDate.valueOf() - a.data.pubDate.valueOf());
---

<SiteLayout title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION}>
	<section class="profile" aria-label="个人介绍">
		<img
			class="profile-mark"
			src={avatar.src}
			alt="你好"
			width="140"
			height="140"
			style="object-fit: cover; aspect-ratio: 1; height: auto;"
		/>
		<div>
			<h1>Desperation_Prof</h1>
			<p class="muted">这里是 Despro 的个人主页</p>
			<div class="profile-links">
				<a class="pill" href="https://github.com/Despr0A">GitHub ↗</a>
				<a class="pill" href="/rss.xml">RSS ↗</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
	<div class="home-content">
		<section class="home-section" aria-labelledby="intro-title">
			<h2 id="intro-title">About</h2>
			<div>
				<p>听好了，所谓Desperation_Prof就是绝望专家，他见证了超高校级的绝望，是要独自面临失败主义和绥靖主义的斗士，的绝望应对专家参上！</p>
				<div class="section-end"><a class="text-link" href="/about/">More about me <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
			</div>
		</section>
		<section class="home-section" aria-labelledby="projects-title">
			<h2 id="projects-title">Projects</h2>
			<div><p>整理中，待上线</p></div>
		</section>
		<section class="home-section" aria-labelledby="posts-title">
			<h2 id="posts-title">Latest Posts</h2>
			<div>
				<p>一些迷思以及笔记，无足挂齿，希望有所帮助</p>
				<PostList posts={posts.slice(0, 2)} compact />
				<div class="section-end" style="margin-top: 16px"><a class="text-link" href="/blog/">View all posts <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</div>
</SiteLayout>
